- Project Plan :
    - Laravel Techologies :
    Admin Panel
        The Admin Panel allows administrators to manage the complete appointment system.
        - Authentication System – Secure admin login and account access.
        - Dashboard – Overview of doctors, patients, appointments, schedules, and system activities.
        - Schedule Management – Manage doctors' availability, working hours, and appointment schedules.
        - Appointment Management – Create, view, manage, confirm, cancel, and reschedule appointments.
        - Notifications – Send appointment-related notifications through Email and WhatsApp.
        - Doctor Management – Add and manage doctors, doctor profiles, and medical specialties.
        - Patient Management – Manage patient records, profiles, previous checkups, appointment history, and medical history.
        - Complaint Management – Manage patient complaints and their responses/status.
        - Accounts – Manage payments, expenses, and financial transactions related to appointments.
        - User Management – Manage system users, staff, roles, and access.
        - Logout – Securely end the admin session.
    Client Portal — React / Next.js
    The Client Portal allows patients to interact with the appointment system online.
        - Authentication System – Patient registration, login, password recovery, and logout.
        - Dashboard – View upcoming appointments, recent activities, and important information.
        - New Appointment – Search/select a doctor or specialist, choose an available date and time, and book an appointment.
        - My Appointments – View and manage current and upcoming appointments.
        - History – View previous appointments, checkups, and visit history.
        - Profile – Manage personal information and account details.
        - Logout – Securely log out of the patient account.
